# An implied position filled by an action reached only through directly-implied actions still has its occupied guarantee propagated to the outermost caller.
define the potential action<my.domain.com:my_lib:/test> {
    it also assigns the action</middle>.
    it also assigns the position</implied_pos>.
    it happens when {
        this particle is created.
    } and it does {
        create a particle in action</middle>::position<trigger_pos>.
        create a particle in position</implied_pos>.
    }
}
